[v056ped5@ubvmsb.cc.buffalo.edu writes:]
[] 1> The new spoiler file mentions versions 3.0.10 and 3.1.0 of the
[]	executable file. I thought these were not available.

they are not available.  the dev team is known to be working on
version 3.1.  version 3.0 pl10 (aka 3.0.10) is strictly a bugfix
distribution that has not been released yet.  umm, bugfix in the
sense that various unfriendly scenarios have been eliminated
(i.e. bag of holding crashes and mega-Hp trolls, etc.).  when
pl10 is released, it will be announced here and other places as
it promises to finally be the end of the line for 3.0!  no, really!

>2> Is debug mode still available in pl9?

in the official binaries explore-more is always available and
debug (wizard) mode is available to those who know the wizard id.

you can usually enter explore-mode with nethack -X or after entering
a game by invoking the "X" command (it is better to use the pre-game
option as you then get a wand of wishing).

